sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant F as libFuzzer<br/>(harness, user space)
    participant P as shared page<br/>(one physical page)
    participant D as harden_local.ko<br/>(kernel)
    participant K as KCOV<br/>(per-task buffer)
    participant S as KASAN
    F->>P: write the mutated bytes (no copy_from_user)
    F->>K: cover[0] = 0 — reset the cursor
    F->>D: ioctl(HARDEN_RUN)
    D->>P: parse the page in 8-byte commands
    D->>K: every executed basic block records its PC
    alt OP_SET_RAW and idx >= HARDEN_SLOTS
        D->>S: slots[idx] = val — out of bounds
        S-->>F: KASAN report, then panic (kasan.fault=panic)
    else in-bounds command
        D-->>F: ioctl returns
    end
    K-->>F: cover[1..n] = the PCs that ran
    F->>F: fold PCs into __libfuzzer_extra_counters
    F->>F: new kernel edge ⇒ new feature ⇒ keep the input (§1.6)
